## 5. Error Codes

| Status | Code | Descripción |
|--------|------|-------------|
| 401 | UNAUTHENTICATED | Token ausente o inválido |
| 401 | TOKEN_EXPIRED | Access token expirado (refresh required) |
| 401 | SCOPE_MISMATCH | Token pertenece a otro scope (no `{{moduleNameLower}}`) |
| 403 | FORBIDDEN | Ability faltante para esta operación |
| 403 | ERR_MIDDLEWARE_MISCONFIGURED | `mk.ability:` sin abilities especificadas |
| 404 | NOT_FOUND | Resource no existe |
| 422 | VALIDATION_ERROR | FormRequest validation failed |

