## 6. Discovery Command

```bash
php artisan mk:discover:abilities [--dry-run] [--force]
```

**Output**:
```
Módulos descubiertos: N
 {{ModuleName}}
  + {{ModuleName}}.viewAny
  + {{ModuleName}}.view
  + {{ModuleName}}.create
  + {{ModuleName}}.update
  + {{ModuleName}}.delete
  + {{ModuleName}}.*
```

Idempotente: corre múltiples veces sin duplicar.

